<text format-version="0.2" work-id="w-songshu" book-id="b-songshu-047" chapter-id="c-songshu-047-liuhuaijing" source-id="s-songshu-047-liuhuaijing-ws2190557">
  <p id="c-songshu-047-liuhuaijing:p001" annotation-status="reviewed" text-layer="received_chapter"><persName id="c-songshu-047-liuhuaijing:p001:m0000" ref="olf_c6j_hmg">懷肅</persName>次弟<persName id="c-songshu-047-liuhuaijing:p001:m0004" ref="cl5_su9_u9f">懷敬</persName>，澀訥無才能。初，高祖產而皇妣殂，孝皇帝貧薄，無由得乳人，議欲不舉高祖。高祖從母生<persName id="c-songshu-047-liuhuaijing:p001:m0047" ref="cl5_su9_u9f">懷敬</persName>，未朞，乃斷<persName id="c-songshu-047-liuhuaijing:p001:m0055" ref="cl5_su9_u9f">懷敬</persName>乳，而自養高祖。高祖以舊恩，<persName id="c-songshu-047-liuhuaijing:p001:m0071" ref="cl5_su9_u9f">懷敬</persName>累見寵授，至會稽太守，尚書，金紫光祿大夫。</p>
</text>
